    m_Localized: Sunglasses
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21405030411792387
    m_Localized: Nothing is free here. What are you going to give me?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21405030411792388
    m_Localized: A dog
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21405030411792389
    m_Localized: A cloud
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21405030411792390
    m_Localized: A coin
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21405030411792391
    m_Localized: Alright, you can go in. Why are you in such a hurry?
